  "word_count": 1044,
  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4 Dental Implants\n\nFixed Teeth vs. Removable\n\nCost & Compare\n\nDental Implant FAQ\n\nAesthetics\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nDental Crowns & Bridges\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nTreatments\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nOral Surgery\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nWho We Are\n\nWhy Choose Us\n\nMeet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nPatient Stories\n\nFor Doctors\n\nReferral Form\n\nContact Us\n\nBlog\n\nCurrent Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria: (703) 940-5410\n\nNew Patients\n\nTysons Corner: (571) 619-9442\n\nAlexandria: (571) 410-3430\n\nBook now\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n## Book Now\n\n\n\n# Meet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\n\nSchedule Now\n\n\n# Meet Our Dentist - McLean, VA\n\n\n\n## Meet Dr. Esam Nahlah\n\n\n\n## Board Certified Prosthodontist\n\n\nDr. Nahlah has been a practicing dentist in California since 2003. In 2013, he moved to Northern Virginia to practice dentistry and has completed the following programs:\n\nHospital Privilege at Inova Fairfax Hospital, the only level 1 Trauma Hospital in Northern Virginia.\n\nDiplomate American Board of Prosthodontics.\n\nCertificate in Prosthodontics.\n\nM.S Master of Science in Oral Biology\n\nCRDTS Central Regional Dental Testing Service\n\nAmerican National Dental Board\n\nIV Sedation Certificate.\n\nAssociate Fellow, American Academy of Implant Dentistry\n\nFellow, International Congress of Oral Implantologists\n\nCalifornia Dental License\n\nCalifornia Dental Board\n\nBLS & ACLS Provider\n\n\n## Award-winning Dentist\n\n\nIn 2013, The American Board of Prosthodontics Awarded Dr. Nahlah the most prestigious award in the field: “Diplomate of American Board of Prosthodontics.”\n\nDr. Nahlah has enjoyed practicing as a specialist in prosthodontic dentistry focusing on esthetic dentistry, implant dentistry, full mouth rehabilitation, and smile makeovers. He has lectured extensively on the subject of smile design and dental implants, and he has several publications in national and international scientific journals.\n\nHowever, Dr. Nahlah is not one to hide his talents or his knowledge from others, In fact, he frequently takes time from his practice to help new dentists in their continuing education. He is respected by many of his peers as an outgoing individual eager to better the profession he works in.\n\n\n## Mentor And Educator\n\n\nAs an educator and mentor, Dr. Nahlah enjoys advancing the careers of many dentists through lecturing and hands-on courses that he offers while inventing advanced techniques in dentistry. With over 19 years of experience, Dr. Nahlah has a passion for teaching dentistry methods for other dentists. He was a clinical instructor at the University of California, San Francisco School of Dentistry before relocating. He is also the founder of a well-known dental study club.\n\n\n### Tysons Study Club\n\n\nThis quarterly study club/symposium is a vision Dr. Nahlah had been cultivating for some time that came to fruition in 2018. It is for dentists by dentists and is geared towards challenging dentist’s thinking on the industry and how to improve. Through the study club, dentists will learn the skills and progressive innovation to provide patients with a higher level of care.\n\n\n## On The Forefront Of His Profession\n\n\nDr. Nahlah is a firm believer in perpetual education and is very active in several professional dental organizations such as:\n\nAmerican College of Prosthodontists\n\nAmerican Academy of Implant Dentistry\n\nAcademy of Osseointegration\n\nDr. Nahlah believes active participation in these and many other similar organizations is crucial for all dental professionals. It helps him stays abreast of the latest techniques and technologies in the dynamic field of prosthodontics and implant dentistry.\n\nDr. Nahlah has practiced aesthetic dentistry, implant dentistry, and prosthodontics for over 19 years. He incorporates the latest technological innovations in dentistry. Treatments such as immediate placement of implants, restoration of implants, computer-guided surgery, digital impressions, as well as veneers and crowns.\n\nDr. Nahlah’s primary focus is practicing dentistry and caring for his patients and improving their lives. In his free time, he enjoys spending time with his wife and family. He often likes to unwind with activities such as motorcycle riding, hiking, and boating and has recently gotten hooked on Peloton cycling.\n\nIf you haven’t experienced the enthusiasm and knowledgeable care of Dr. Nahlah, contact us today to schedule a consultation.\n\n\n## Get on the path to better dental health!\n\n\nRequest a consultation now.\n\nBook Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddresses:\n\nTysons Corner\n\n7901 Jones Branch Dr., Suite 220\n\nMcLean, VA 22102\n\nNew Patients: (571) 619-9442\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 448-3312\n\nAlexandria\n\n2855 Duke St,\n\nAlexandria, VA 22314\n\nNew Patients: (571) 410-3430\n\nCurrent Patients: (703) 940-5410\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 8:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 8:00am – 2:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\nAll-On-4® Implants\n\nCrowns & Bridges\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nMeet the Doctor\n\nAbout Us\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\n2025 Dr. Nahlah. All rights reserved",
